  "description": "Earnest are delighted to present this spacious two-bedroom apartment in the popular and mature Rosevale Mansions development, ideally located just off the Howth Road and beside St Anne’s Park. Raheny and Killester villages are also within easy reach, offering a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities.\n\nSituated on the second floor (no lift), the accommodation comprises a spacious entrance hallway, fully fitted kitchen with gas hob, dining area and bright open-plan living room. The kitchen flows naturally into the dining and living areas, with a partition wall providing separation while retaining a good sense of space.\n\nThere are two well-proportioned double bedrooms, with built-in wardrobes in the main bedroom. The second bedroom would also suit use as a home office or guest room. The bathroom includes a bath, electric shower and window for natural ventilation.\n\nThe property also benefits from a separate storage room, additional hot press, designated parking and carpet flooring throughout the hallway, living room and bedrooms.\n\nA well-located and spacious apartment offering comfortable accommodation close to St Anne’s Park, Howth Road, Raheny and Killester.\nExcellent local transport links with busy bus corridor on the Howth road serving many routes and Raheny and Killester DART stations all within walk distance. \n\nPlease respond with some info about yourself and the agent will be in touch with viewing times !!!",
